---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageBanner from '../components/PageBanner.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import CtaBanner from '../components/CtaBanner.astro';

const mission = [
  'Maintain High Ethical standards',
  'Problem-Solving Solutions that Assist our Customers in Achieving Their Objectives',
  'Offering exceptional value in the Cargo Logistics Marketplace',
  'Be an Active Community Partner',
  'Custom Clearance and Compliance Service',
  'Provide Best Cargo Transportation and Logistics Services to our Customer\'s',
  'Connect the World\'s Professionals to Make Them More Productive and Successful',
  'Setting the Standard for Professionalism in the Logistic Solutions we provide',
  'Freight Security',
  'Ensure complete security and confidentiality',
];
---
<Layout title="About Us | TPC Cargo">
  <PageBanner title="About Us" />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <SectionHeading badge="About TPC Cargo" title="We are [TPC Cargo!]" />
        <img src="/images/about.svg" alt="TPC Cargo" class="mt-6 aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-lg object-cover" />
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4 lg:pt-4">
        <p class="text-muted">Our Core Business is organization and performance of Combined Transport from/to Cyprus throughout Europe. Over time, we have consolidated a national and international dedicated network of partners -globally.</p>
        <p class="text-muted">Since the beginning, TPC Express Cargo has carried out pioneering work in the development of combined transport road/sea/air, and regardless of your needs, even if it’s an import-export to/from Cyprus or a personal/corporate need of transport and relocation services, our highly-qualified employees and partners are responsible for the success of your order – from booking until delivery to the final destination- FCL/LCL/FTL/LTL</p>
        <p class="text-muted">With a vast experience in the field of freight transport at the national and international levels, we offer combined sea/road/air logistics and transport solutions for a multitude of industries such as construction, retail, agriculture, automotive, FMCG, relocations etc.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4 lg:pt-2">
        <p class="text-muted">Our main objective is to help our clients, through efficient transport and logistics solutions, to choose the right way to any national and international destination.</p>
        <p class="text-muted">A young, flexible team responds with immediate transport solutions to enable customers and partners around the world to connect with each other. We are specialized in the dynamics of the transport industry, proactively focused on efficient transport solutions. We are constantly in touch with our partners and we monitor the transports in good safety conditions.</p>
        <p class="text-muted">In a constantly changing economy and increasing of suppliers/consumers destinations requests, requires innovative transport solutions which connect different countries, and reduce transit time and costs – it’s a must.</p>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/port.svg" alt="Port" class="aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-lg object-cover" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-cream">
    <div class="wrap grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <SectionHeading badge="Who we are" title="Our [Mission]" />
      <ul class="grid gap-x-8 gap-y-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-2">
        {mission.map((m) => (
          <li class="flex gap-3 text-sm"><Icon name="check" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand" />{m}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBanner title="Not sure which solution fits [your business needs?]" />
</Layout>
